I've also been thought
of as somebody who's

00:48:54.630 --> 00:48:57.450
on the left and then on the
right, mistakenly over my life.

00:48:57.450 --> 00:49:00.770
I find the left is really
more brutal than the right.

00:49:00.770 --> 00:49:02.070
I mean, I used to tear people

00:49:02.070 --> 00:49:04.040
in the conservative
community a new asshole

00:49:04.040 --> 00:49:04.873
when I'd meet 'em.

00:49:04.873 --> 00:49:08.440
They could at least laugh about it.

00:49:08.440 --> 00:49:11.120
The left, man, it can get dangerous.

00:49:11.120 --> 00:49:11.953
You know.

00:49:11.953 --> 00:49:13.450
You're gonna catch a D sale on a tube sock

00:49:13.450 --> 00:49:14.300
