00:49:18.750 --> 00:49:20.490
Like, you first go on
"O'Reilly" maybe you have this--

00:49:20.490 --> 00:49:21.730
- Nah, I wasn't.

00:49:21.730 --> 00:49:24.710
Mort Sahl wrote a great book
years ago called "Heartland".

00:49:24.710 --> 00:49:25.900
- Ah, I need to read it.
- And I think when people

00:49:25.900 --> 00:49:27.620
think back on Mort Sahl they always

00:49:27.620 --> 00:49:28.750
think of him as liberal.

00:49:28.750 --> 00:49:31.720
Probably because he was Sancho Panza,

00:49:31.720 --> 00:49:33.533
or Boswelled at Kennedy's Jack,

00:49:35.320 --> 00:49:36.350
well, what am I thinking?

00:49:36.350 --> 00:49:38.940
Boswell's Sam Johnson to
Kennedy's Sam Johnson.

00:49:38.940 --> 00:49:40.010
He was his chronicler.

00:49:40.010 --> 00:49:42.980
And he liked being in
the, with the cool kids.

00:49:42.980 --> 00:49:44.520
But he started to see it,

00:49:44.520 --> 00:49:46.760
and he started talking about liberalism.

00:49:46.760 --> 00:49:48.560
And he was a real hipster, Mort.

00:49:48.560 --> 00:49:49.670
I don't even know if
Mort's still up there,

00:49:49.670 --> 00:49:52.110
or maybe he's passed.
- No, no, he's still alive.

00:49:52.110 --> 00:49:54.040
Unless something happened
in the last week.

00:49:54.040 --> 00:49:55.507
I'm 99% sure he's still alive.
- And I just started

00:49:55.507 --> 00:49:56.850
having that epiphany.

00:49:56.850 --> 00:49:58.640
I remember what happened with Stockdale.

00:49:58.640 --> 00:50:00.397
I remember everybody's
making fun of Stockdale.

00:50:00.397 --> 00:50:02.990
And I think McCain had
told me once that Stockdale

00:50:02.990 --> 00:50:04.630
when he was in the Hanoi Hilton,

00:50:04.630 --> 00:50:07.180
when kids had given up and they
were gonna kill themselves,

00:50:07.180 --> 00:50:09.130
