00:50:24.667 --> 00:50:25.668
"I don't even know why I am here."

00:50:25.668 --> 00:50:26.501
- Why I'm up here.
- And everybody

00:50:26.501 --> 00:50:27.440
makes him an asshole.

00:50:27.440 --> 00:50:30.000
And I thought, "This room's
gotten too hip for me, man."

00:50:30.000 --> 00:50:33.280
If we're gonna start, like
talking about Stockdale,

00:50:33.280 --> 00:50:37.510
like he's an idiot, and Nancy
Pelosi's a viable player,

00:50:37.510 --> 00:50:39.190
I just thought, I can't be in the libs.

00:50:39.190 --> 00:50:41.090
They ask too much of the lockstep.

00:50:41.090 --> 00:50:44.210
- Yeah, you think the
Republicans have any sort of

00:50:44.210 --> 00:50:45.520
