00:50:45.520 --> 00:50:47.970
- I have found out, but I
can only speak for myself.

00:50:47.970 --> 00:50:51.240
Like I said, I've poked a
lot of fun at conservatives.

00:50:51.240 --> 00:50:53.450
And I've met some who've hated my guts,

00:50:53.450 --> 00:50:56.130
