least laughed about it a little.

00:50:56.130 --> 00:50:57.150
That's just my experience.

00:50:57.150 --> 00:51:00.540
I have the people on the left
do not take a joke as well.

00:51:00.540 --> 00:51:02.250
I think that's kinda, I don't think I'm

00:51:02.250 --> 00:51:04.190
saying anything sacrilegious there.

00:51:04.190 --> 00:51:05.940
I think a lot of people are noticing that.

00:51:05.940 --> 00:51:07.120
Guess what nobody wants to say.

00:51:07.120 --> 00:51:07.953
- I hear you, Miller.

00:51:07.953 --> 00:51:10.170
It's been my life.
- You don't wanna end up

00:51:10.170 --> 00:51:11.390
