depiction of his inner voice.

00:51:23.660 --> 00:51:24.730
Whereas, I don't think somebody

00:51:24.730 --> 00:51:26.660
like Hilary Clinton's
inner voice and outer voice

00:51:26.660 --> 00:51:28.900
