they wake up in the morning,

00:51:40.040 --> 00:51:41.900
what they, he's not gonna quit tweeting.

00:51:41.900 --> 00:51:44.370
He doesn't drink, so lighten up, assholes

00:51:44.370 --> 00:51:45.930
