00:52:33.160 --> 00:52:34.907
There are days he goes
after people and I think,

00:52:34.907 --> 00:52:38.540
"Brother, that is so
thin-skinned, I can't believe it."

00:52:38.540 --> 00:52:40.590
Are there other days I
